","comments":[{"url":"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/2858#discussion_r4344430982","body":"Usage can be assigned to a line that never appears in the output. For the sequence `m1` thinking-only fragment → tool-result-only user entry → visible `m1` fragment, thinking removal leaves the first message with `[]`, which `Folder.line` suppresses. This assignment makes the visible fragment a continuation, so it emits no usage; `OpUsage` updates only the suppressed owner. Even the full converted transcript then omits the call's token counts and model. Ensure the selected snapshot reaches an emitted line, either by transferring ownership to a visible fragment or retaining usage-bearing empty owners. Add a regression test asserting that this sequence emits the best snapshot exactly once.","user":{"login":"Copilot","name":"Copilot","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/946600?v=4","id":175728472},"id":4344430982,"pull_request_review_id":5609122134,"in_reply_to_id":null,"created_at":"2026-10-22T04:04:45Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T04:04:46Z","review":null,"side":"RIGHT","line":null,"start_line":null,"path":"transcript/jsonl_records.go","body_html":"<p dir="auto">Usage can be assigned to a line that never appears in the output. For the sequence <code class="notranslate">m1</code> thinking-only fragment → tool-result-only user entry → visible <code class="notranslate">m1</code> fragment, thinking removal leaves the first message with <code class="notranslate">[]</code>, which <code class="notranslate">Folder.line</code> suppresses. This assignment makes the visible fragment a continuation, so it emits no usage; <code class="notranslate">OpUsage</code> updates only the suppressed owner. Even the full converted transcript then omits the call's token counts and model. Ensure the selected snapshot reaches an emitted line, either by transferring ownership to a visible fragment or retaining usage-bearing empty owners. Add a regression test asserting that this sequence emits the best snapshot exactly once.</p>"},{"url":"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/2858#pullrequestreview-5609122134","body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->

### 🟡 Changes recommended

Interrupted calls can lose all emitted usage when their usage owner is a suppressed thinking-only message.

